<title>UK: UK Oct oil output up 0.09 to 2.63 mln bpd - WoodMa.</title>
<headline>UK Oct oil output up 0.09 to 2.63 mln bpd - WoodMa.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.K. oil production in October rose by 90,000 barrels per day (bpd) to 2.632 million bpd from 2.542 million in September, consultants Wood Mackenzie said.</p>
